OL,4,G1915FSunday Feature: New Music New York
OL,5,     GAgainst a backdrop of financial
OL,6,     Gcrisis and disinvestment in New
OL,7,     GYork City, New Music was born.
OL,8,     GWriter Richard King explores the
OL,9,     Gconditions for creativity in New
OL,10,     GYork in the 1970s.
OL,11,G2000FSchumann and Bernstein
OL,12,     GContinuing BBC Radio 3's
OL,13,     Gcelebration of American music,
OL,14,     Ghere are two less-well known
OL,15,     Gpieces from the States - William
OL,16,     GSchuman's Fifth Symphony and
OL,17,     GLeonard Bernstein's Songfest.
